---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import EnquiryForm from '../components/EnquiryForm.astro';
import { S, C, R, U, crumbsLd } from '../lib/site.js';
---
<Base
  title="About 555 Holidays: Bhutan, the Way We Live It"
  description="555 Holidays is a Bhutanese-owned, licensed travel agency for slow, unhurried journeys: short drives, local life and time to rest. Offices in Thimphu, Washington DC and India."
  image="/images/exp-farmhouse.jpg"
  jsonld={[crumbsLd([['Home', '/'], ['About', U.about]])]}
>
<PageHero img="/images/exp-farmhouse.jpg" alt="A traditional Bhutanese farmhouse beneath snow-capped peaks" page="about" crumbs={[['About']]}
  title="Bhutan, the way we live it."
  sub="Hundreds of agents sell the same Bhutan. We share the one we live." />

<main id="main">
<section style="padding-top:clamp(60px,6vw,100px)">
  <svg class="swirl" style="top:50%;height:300px" viewBox="0 0 1200 300" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M-20 60 C100 40 160 120 240 200 C320 280 420 250 430 170 C440 90 360 60 330 140 C290 250 380 300 560 290 C760 280 1000 220 1220 200"/></svg>
  <div class="wrap z">
    <div class="story">
      <span class="label rv" style="margin-top:.6em">About 555 Holidays</span>
      <div class="text rv">
        <p>We grew up in Bhutan. For us, it is a gift from our kings: a land still untouched, much like the world looked before modernism.</p>
        <p>There are hundreds of travel agents here, and most trips look the same: monasteries, mountain roads, long hours in a car. That history is the same everywhere, and you can read it in a book.</p>
        <p>But for us, Bhutan is something else. It is waking up slowly. Breakfast with no rush. No traffic, no tight schedule, and time to take our own time.</p>
        <p>That is why we started 555 Holidays: to show you Bhutan as we know it, not as everyone else shows it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="story-photo rv"><figure class="pcard"><img src="/images/exp-lamps.jpg" alt="Rows of butter lamps at the Memorial Chorten in Thimphu" loading="lazy"><figcaption class="cap">Butter lamps at the Memorial Chorten, Thimphu</figcaption></figure></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="lead rv"><span class="label">How we travel</span><h2 class="h2">What makes us different</h2></div>
    <ol class="diff rv">
      <li><b>Slow by design</b><span>Short drives, fewer stops, more time in each place.</span></li>
      <li><b>Local life, not a checklist</b><span>Meals, homes, and everyday moments with the people who live here.</span></li>
      <li><b>Bhutanese-owned and run</b><span>You deal directly with us, not a middleman.</span></li>
      <li><b>Small and personal</b><span>Your trip is planned around your pace, not a fixed route.</span></li>
      <li><b>Licensed and trusted</b><span>Fully licensed to operate in Bhutan (Licence No. {C.licence}).</span></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="promise rv">
      <span class="kicker">Our promise</span>
      <blockquote>You will not feel rushed. You will go home rested, with real stories instead of a long list of sights.</blockquote>
      <p>Hundreds of agents sell the same Bhutan. We share the one we live.</p>
      <p class="sign">Come slow down with us.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="guides">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="lead rv"><span class="label">The people you'll travel with</span><h2 class="h2">Our guides</h2></div>
    <div class="guides" set:html={S.guides.map(R.guide).join('')} />
  </div>
</section>

<section id="offices" aria-labelledby="off-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="lead rv"><span class="label">Where to find us</span><h2 class="h2" id="off-h">Our offices</h2></div>
    <div class="offices" set:html={C.offices.map(R.office).join('')} />
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding-top:clamp(60px,6vw,100px)" aria-label="Licences and memberships">
  <div class="wrap"><div class="trust rv" set:html={R.trust()} /></div>
</section>

<section style="padding-top:clamp(60px,6vw,100px)">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cta-block rv">
      <img src="/images/dest-phobjikha.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy">
      <div><h2>Let's plan something together</h2><p class="intro">Tell us a little about yourself and what draws you to Bhutan. We'll take it from there.</p></div>
      <EnquiryForm title="Start a conversation" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</main>
</Base>
